     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I am trying to write a utility using Shiny, where the user selects certain dates and I would fetch the necessary files off an FTP server. browseURL would be ideal, but does not work when the code has been uploaded to Shiny&#39;s server. I have read on a forum (<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?pli=1#!topic/shiny-discuss/ImTi-5SQavQ\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(12,101,165)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?pli%3D1%23!topic/shiny-discuss/ImTi-5SQavQ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397556973000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dD1IFbu-nnB30rNxJ885Z\">link</a>) where they recommended using javascript.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">My current strategy is to take the user input and write it to a js file and then have the user call the script. The problem on the local server is, when the user clicks &quot;Begin download&quot;, it only retrieves the old JS script (from a previous job) not the newly selected dates.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I think the problem is, when I &quot;include&quot; the files, it only occurs once at the start and doesn&#39;t update again within the utility.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Possible solution? - Call openWin() as a function within server.R, but I am not sure if this is possible.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><strong>JS:</strong></p><pre style=\"padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> openWin</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nwindow.open</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;<a href=\"ftp://cddis.gsfc.nasa.gov/gps/products/1834/igs18344.sp3.Z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ftp://cddis.gsfc.nasa.gov/gps/products/1834/igs18344.sp3.Z</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> \r\nwindow.open</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;<a href=\"ftp://cddis.gsfc.nasa.gov/gps/products/1851/igs18512.sp3.Z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ftp://cddis.gsfc.nasa.gov/gps/products/1851/igs18512.sp3.Z</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">}</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><strong>html:</strong></p><pre style=\"padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input type</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;button&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> value</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Begin Download&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> onclick</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;openWin()&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&gt;</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><strong>UI.R</strong></p><pre style=\"padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">   includeScript</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;myfile.js&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n   includeHTML</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;myfile.html&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">The JS scripts on the web based server does not update, even though the logs show the changes.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><strong>Online Shiny Server logs</strong></p><pre style=\"padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">2015-07-23</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">T03</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">45</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">55.370067+00</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">00</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> shinyapps</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">51987</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">]:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> The following objects are masked from ‘package</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">methods’</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">2015-07-23</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">T03</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">45</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><s